{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DIS","id":"362408476372369410","is_bot":0,"username":".disassembly"},"author_id":"362408476372369410","channel_id":"636016940489506837","content":"Directed repeatedly to the restroom, Gneiss lets out a sigh of discontent and enters the lavatory and ensures he is alone. He starts to take a knee, but then thinks better of it. He mutters beneath his breath a prayer, \"Hail, Queen of forge, fire-worker and metal-shaper, carver and crafter, the Iron Maiden. Open the way into your workshop. Teach me the paths of hammer and measure, guide my hand in both creation and repair. By anvil and spark, by metal and wood and blade, Lady M, Hail.\" before dropping a single iron-wrought nail and exiting the temple's facilities and makes his way out to the streets of <#732867492040540210>","created_at":"2020-07-19T17:48:01.221000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-19T17:48:26.796000Z","id":"734466591827165245","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
